omx-panel (0.16.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * test: one tree grep for the name guards, read from the files; two more
    guards used git grep
  * ci: the renderer, store and meter jobs install plugin-db-contract, whose
    lv2 domain the layout reads
  * omx-panel 0.16.1: the release builds run their checks from a tree with no
    .git and with no panel domain installed
  * installed-tools-check: the staged tools read the panel domain the same
    build staged
  * units-standard: the plugin-hostd guard reads the files itself, no git grep

